<LanguageData>
  <GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->We've intercepted radio transmissions from a seemingly abandoned genetics research lab not far from [map_definite]. The site may have some interesting ancient technology scattered around, so it could be a good idea to investigate it.\n\nWe should be well prepared, as genetic monstrosities may still be roaming the derelict installation.--><li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;我们刚刚截获了一段未加密的无线电信号，其源头似乎来自[map_definite]附近的一处已废弃的基因工程实验基地。那里可能仍残留着不少有用的远古科技与各种资源，或许值得我们前去一探究竟。\n\n由于实验基地内部的状况并不明朗，为了防止意外发生，我们应该在出发前先做好万全的准备。</li></GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
