  <GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.0.text>截获的通讯表明废弃的实验室已被其他人洗劫一空。任务 [resolvedQuestName] 已过期。</GR_OpportunitySite_AbandonedLab.root.nodes.9.node.nodes.0.text>
  <GR_OpportunitySite_BiomechanicalLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]向我们透露了一条消息。看起来，旅途中的[siteFaction_pawnsPlural]与他们的驮运动物正在我们附近的某处停歇。\n[asker_nameDef]告诉了我们这支商队的落脚处，或许可以打他们一个措手不及。<!--EN: questDescription(askerIsNull==true)->The biomechanical lab beacon managed to decode the strange radio signals emanating from inside the strange mechanoid chip, revealing the coordinates of a lab complex not far from [map_definite]. This site seems to have been better hidden than the abandoned labs we have been exploring lately.\n\nThe beacon also revealed the original function of the lab complex: infusing paragon hybrids with reconstructive mechanites to somehow increase their power. Perhaps we should travel to the site with some of these hybrids.--><li>questDescription(askerIsNull==true)-&gt;我们已经成功破译了机械生物实验基地信标发出的无线电信号，它向我们指明了[map_definite]附近的一处更为隐秘的机械生物实验基地。\n\n此外我们还从中了解到，这座实验基地似乎可以将无瑕生物改造成更加强大的机械生物。或许我们应该带上几只无瑕生物一同前往。</li></GR_OpportunitySite_BiomechanicalLab.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
